@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST disconnect: stop sync, preserve frozen access/history

autonumber
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "REST / RestAlchemy controller" as API
database "Account / credential / lease / mappings / outbox" as DB
participant "Bridge instance" as Bridge
database "Ready public events" as Events
participant "WebSocket dispatcher" as WS

Client -> API : POST disconnect
API -> DB : lock account; status=disconnected
API -> DB : revoke/increment lease generation + outbox
API --> Client : 200 sanitized disconnected snapshot
DB --> Bridge : stale generation; stop sync/provider calls
DB -> Events : external_account.updated with projection transaction
WS -> Events : replay/live
WS -> Client : current-contract event

note over API,DB
  Credential/account, mappings, user bindings and visible history remain.
  History is frozen/readable; new provider events stop.
  Disconnect is not Delete.
end note
@enduml
